// LiveCounters — three cards anchored by People / Power / Purpose.
//
// Every card is a clickable region picker: clicking any card advances
// to the next live region (BW → ZA → NG → ZW → BW). The numbers, flag,
// tax-authority forms, and native-language greeting all swap per
// region — these are not decorative cards, they're a second region
// picker on top of the Africa map.

